+     * `doId` its binding was minted with. Naming it here is what lets a
+     * Durable Object of any class host a workspace: before, the supervisor
+     * resolved `env.NIMBUS_SESSION` for a class an embedder does not run, so
+     * an embedder's facet could reach nothing even holding a valid binding.
+     */
